# status：空仓库只有 master；改动后各类文件进对应小节
> init
<<<

# 空仓库：只有 Branches 节有 *master，其余小节为空
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<

# 追踪 wug.txt 并提交，再造各类改动
+ wug.txt wug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "add wug"
<<<
> branch zbranch
<<<

# 新文件暂存（Staged）
+ added.txt notwug.txt
> add added.txt
<<<

# 已追踪文件标记删除（Removed）
> rm wug.txt
<<<

> status
=== Branches ===
*master
zbranch

=== Staged Files ===
added.txt

=== Removed Files ===
wug.txt

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
